## 1. Document Schema API

Inspect the schema endpoint definition below. You can switch tabs to view the `cURL` invocation or the raw response model.

<ApiEndpoint
  method="GET"
  path="/api/v1/schema"
  description="Retrieves the full JSON schema definition for the technical document specification."
  curlExample={`curl -X GET "https://api.docs.internal/v1/schema" \\\n  -H "Accept: application/json"`}
  responseExample={`{\n  "status": "success",\n  "version": "1.0.0",\n  "schema_type": "draft-07"\n}`}
/>

