## 3. Compiler Execution API

Below is the specification for executing single-file compilation pipelines programmatically:

<ApiEndpoint
  method="POST"
  path="/api/v1/compile"
  description="Submits an SVX documentation AST to be compiled into a single-file HTML bundle."
  requestBody={`{\n  "entrypoint": "src/content/index.svx",\n  "minify": true,\n  "dualTheme": true,\n  "offlineMode": true\n}`}
  curlExample={`curl -X POST "https://api.docs.internal/v1/compile" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"entrypoint": "src/content/index.svx", "dualTheme": true}'`}
  responseExample={`{\n  "bundle_size_kb": 412,\n  "status": "compiled",\n  "output": "dist/index.html",\n  "external_requests": 0\n}`}
/>

---

## 4. Code Block Highlight Demonstration

```python
import json

def validate_offline_spec(document_path: str) -> bool:
    """Validates that a document bundle contains no external HTTP requests."""
    with open(document_path, "r", encoding="utf-8") as f:
        content = f.read()
    
    # Check for external script/stylesheet links
    assert "http://" not in content
    assert "https://" not in content
    return True
```
